*.ps1
# Eigen IS tracked in this repository, deliberately.
# This rule was inherited from quevotan-api's nominate_cmodule/.gitignore when the
# engine was copied here, and it is why the published package shipped with no Eigen/
# at all: the directory was present on the machine that pushed it and git dropped it
# in silence. This is a REPLICATION package; a reader must be able to build from a
# clean clone, so the header-only dependency travels with it (MPL2, COPYING.MPL2
# retained). Do not re-add an ignore rule for it.
# /Eigen
